  "title": {
   "en": "Crazy Run"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "クレイジーラン"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "After setting the fastest time in the nation for a middle school second year, Uzuki Jun is hailed as a genius runner. Expected to dominate the world of track and field, he suddenly disappears from the public eye. But once he enters high school, he's back in the competitive scene! But he no longer looks like he did -- now with bleached hair and a provocative demeanor, he's far from the image of an athlete! Everyone around him is shocked, but how did his skill hold up?",
   "ja": "中学2年で全国最高タイムを叩き出し、天才ランナーと称された卯月俊。陸上界を席巻する存在として期待されていたが、突如表舞台から姿を消す。そんな彼が高校進学を機に競技へ復帰！しかし、その姿に当時の面影はなく金髪チャラ男というアスリートとはかけ離れた見た目に…！絶句する周囲だが、果たしてその実力は──！？"
  },
